<li><img src="http://www.weiqiangart.com/upload/02cc23c65bb4a5ab/76c69a41c4b09153.jpg" alt=""><div class="works-absolute flex-y-center"><h3>04</h3><p>色彩静物作品</p><span></span><!-- <a href="/works_index.html">马上查看</a> --><a href="/works_index.html?category_id=33">马上查看</a></div></li><li><img src="http://www.weiqiangart.com/upload/a86a828da7354d05/f32a76466032bf98.jpg" alt=""><div class="works-absolute flex-y-center"><h3>05</h3><p>色彩静物作品</p><span></span><!-- <a href="/works_index.html">马上查看</a> --><a href="/works_index.html?category_id=33">马上查看</a></div></li><li><img src="http://www.weiqiangart.com/upload/83483b034e591952/9c5e86cfeecf25bd.jpg" alt=""><div class="works-absolute flex-y-center"><h3>06</h3><p>色彩静物作品</p><span></span><!-- <a href="/works_index.html">马上查看</a> --><a href="/works_index.html?category_id=33">马上查看</a></div></li><li><img src="http://www.weiqiangart.com/upload/d45e18eeb385f463/340e3b98e6d198c3.jpg" alt=""><div class="works-absolute flex-y-center"><h3>07</h3><p>色彩静物作品</p><span></span><!-- <a href="/works_index.html">马上查看</a> --><a href="/works_index.html?category_id=33">马上查看</a></div></li><li><img src="http://www.weiqiangart.com/upload/31b1adbf96c10a60/585c3eb7f3199531.jpg" alt=""><div class="works-absolute flex-y-center"><h3>08</h3><p>色彩静物作品</p><span></span><!-- <a href="/works_index.html">马上查看</a> --><a href="/works_index.html?category_id=33">马上查看</a></div></li></ul></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="index-workslist"><div class="works-left"><h4>学生作品</h4><p>有那么一群人用自己的努力收获了专业的进步！也许他们曾是基础薄弱甚至他们曾是零基础但是他们用付出的汗水浇灌出了进步</p></div><ul class="img-list"><li><img src="http://www.weiqiangart.com/upload/8c5973eb6b01f34b/688f5e13ef9c1985.jpg" alt="广州画室设计培训,广州设计集训画室,广州设计美术培训班"><div class="works-absolute flex-y-center"><h3>01</h3><p>设计</p><span></span><a href="/works_student.html?category_id=42">马上查看</a></div></li><li><img src="http://www.weiqiangart.com/upload/a4bbc5683a58e773/cf171fec69d42df1.jpg" alt="广州画室设计培训,广州设计集训画室,广州设计美术培训班"><div class="works-ab